\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every fixed integer $K\geq 2$, can 3SAT be reduced deterministically in polynomial time to an explicit finite simple unweighted graph and positive integer threshold k so that satisfiable inputs have minimum uncut-edge count $\leq k$ and unsatisfiable inputs have count $>Kk$?

